{"file":"pm-1.0.0-v1.zip","bytes":66241,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"pm","description":"Your project lead. Plans projects, guides builds, troubleshoots problems, makes decisions, tracks progress, and ensures quality — everything except writing the code.","version":"1.0.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/helixis-plugins/pm","homepage":"https://github.com/helixis-plugins/pm","keywords":["project-management","planning","build-packages","troubleshooting","quality-assurance"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/build-guidance/SKILL.md","name":"build-guidance","description":"Analyzes the next package spec and provides specific guidance on what to do next, what to tell Builder, and what to prepare.","headings":["Build Guidance","Two Modes","Mode 1: No package active — guide to next package","Mode 2: Package in progress — guide within active package","Mode 1: Next Package Briefing","Step 1: Identify the next package","Step 2: Read the package spec","Step 3: Identify pre-requisites","Step 4: Generate the launch command","Step 5: Recommend involvement mode","Step 6: Anticipate Builder questions","Step 7: Identify red flags","Step 8: Present the briefing","Mode 2: In-Progress Guidance","Step 1: Read active package state","Step 2: Identify the current task","Step 3: Check for blockers","Step 4: Present in-progress guidance"],"name_hint":"构建 · guidance","description_zh":"分析下一个构建包的规格，明确下一步工作、给 Builder 的说明及需要准备的材料。"},{"path":"skills/decision-support/SKILL.md","name":"decision-support","description":"Structures decisions with options, trade-offs, and recommendations. Logs resolved decisions to DECISIONS.md with auto-incrementing IDs.","headings":["Decision Support","Explicit Decision Flow","Step 1: Decision intake","Step 2: Structure the options","Step 3: Make a recommendation","Step 4: User chooses","Step 5: Log to DECISIONS.md","D-XXX: [Title]","Step 6: Confirm","Auto-Detection","Reading Existing Decisions","What NOT to Do"],"nam